        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko nzoharekurira ikīza, nkuzuza ibitenga vy’amaraso mu nzira zaho; kand’ abakomeretse bazogwa hagati muri ho, bishwe n’inkota ihateye impande zose; maze bazomenya yuko jewe nd’ Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
